{
  "id": "1SA.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samuele 6",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimbaŋu chaYehova chashakamini mumpata yawaFwilistinu tukweji tutanu natuyedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AFwilistinu hiyakutambika ayikombejina wakwakuhopa, nawu, Tukwila pahi nachimbaŋu chaYehova? Tulejenuyitwakachitemesha nachu kwachu kuchekala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elili nawu, Neyi mukutemeshachimbapu chaNzambi yaIsarela, bayi muchitemesha makasakasaku; chiŋa muchifuntisha nahimulambu wakutanya akayuki, mwakeluki chanabuliliyi kuyifumisha chikasa chindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehwili nawu, Mulambu wakutanyawutwakafuntisha nachu kudi yena mulambwinyi? Nawu, Tusuŋuhutitwawuru tutanu, ninfwa jawuru jitanu, mwomwekalila tulamba twawa-Fwilistinu, muloŋa chipupu chimunamoni enu wejima wenu hamu nawatulambatwenu chochimu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelenu nkishi jadifwana natusuŋuhutitwenu, ninkishi jadifwana nanfwa jenu jidi nakukisapana ituŋa, mwakamulemeshi Nzambi yaIsarela; hadaha wakapepelesha chikasa chindi nihadenunihadi akishi enu, nihetuŋa denu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu mukuchinchikishiladi nyichima yenu neyi chachinchikishiluwu aEjipitu naFwaro nyichima yawu? Chayikomwesheliyi hiyayilekeli antu akadiyili kwawuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu kwatenukukusoŋa itemba dadiha, mwakakwati aŋombi ayedi achidi kwamwisha, achidi kanda asendaŋahu dehi mpanda, mwakakasi aŋombi kwitemba, anyanawu mwakayenzeleli mwitaŋa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwakanoni chimbaŋu chaYehova, mwakachishi hetemba niyuma yawuru yahimulambu wakutanya yimwakafuntisha nachu kudi yena, mwakayishi muchikasha, chikasha mwakachishikumbadi yachimbaŋu; mwakachitemeshi, chakayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mwakamona hichikuya munjila yakuŋinza yachu kuBetishemeshi, komana diyi natukoŋi chumichi chasweja kutama; neyi nehi, twakeluka netu chikasa chindi hidichi chatukatishiluku, chadiŋi chuma chakudinjila tuhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ela nimwenomu, hiyakukwata aŋombi ayedi achidi kwamwisha, hiyakuyikasila kwitemba, anyanawu hiyakuyenzelela mwitaŋa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakushachimbaŋu chaYehova hetemba, hamu nachikasha chi kweti infwajawuru ninkishi jatusuŋuhuti twawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋombi hiyakwimakana munjila yakuBetishemeshi; hiyakuya mumukwakwa weneni, iku nakuya iku nakwaŋula, kusenukamu aya hela kuchikasa chachidiilu hela kuchimunswa nehi. Tulamba twawaFwilistinu adiŋi nakuyilondela munyima nikuŋinza yakuBetishemeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AkwaBetishemeshi adiŋi nakwaŋula tidiku yawu muchinekineki; hiyakufumbula mesu awu, hiyakumona chimbaŋu. Chachimwenuwu azaŋaleli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itemba diiŋila nimwiha daYoshuwa mukwaBetishemeshi, diimana nikwenoku kwadiŋi ilola deneni. Hiyakubalula nyitonduyetemba, hiyakumushitila Yehova aŋombi owu ahimulambu wakushita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ALevi hiyakutulula chimbaŋu chaYehova, nichikasha chadiŋuku, mwadiŋi yuma yawuru, hiyakuyisha helola deneni. Antu akuBetishemeshi hiyakushita nyilambu yakushita, hiyakumuketwila Yehova niyimuna ifukudodenodu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulamba twawaFwilistinu atanu chachimwenuwu hiyakufunta kuEkeroni dodena ifuku odu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu tusuŋuhuti twawuru twamulambu waYehova wakutanya twafuntishiluwu nachu aFwilistinu chimbaŋu; elili kamu kaAshidodi, kamu kaGaza, kamu kaAshekeloni, kamu kaGati, kamu kaEkeroni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ninfwajawuru jamwekalila ŋanda jawaFwilistinu jejima jikweti tulamba tutanu, niŋanda jampwembu, nitunyikala twamumpata, yashika ndo nikwiloladeneni, datulililuwu chimbaŋu chaYehova, kwoku dekala nilelu mwiha daYoshuwa, mukwaBetishemeshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wajahili antu akuBetishemeshi, muloŋa atalili muchimbaŋu chaYehova, hadi antu wajahiluhu amayala makombakaji makumi atanu namakumi atanu nayedi; antu hiyakudila nanochu chaswejeliyi Yehova kujaha antu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala akuBetishemeshi elili nawu, Hinyi natweshi kwimana kumesu aYehova Nzambi wajiliwu? Wukuya kudinyi kulonda atufumi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakutemesha antemesha kudi eniKiriyati Yeyarimi, nawu, AFwilistinu anatuleteli dehi cheŋi chimbaŋu chaYehova; kunkumukenu muchitambuli, chinzi oku kudenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
